---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import listening from '../../../../assets/brand/mascot-listening.png';
import local from '../../assets/landing/local-select.webp';
---
<div class="tn-features">
  <article class="library">
    <div class="feature-copy">
      <h3>一本本收好，一章章读完。</h3>
      <p>本地 TXT 与网络书源都能读。自动识别 UTF-8 / GBK，按卷与章整理目录，阅读进度自动保存。</p>
      <a href="/TRNovel/guides/read/">了解阅读方式 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
    <Image src={local} width={660} alt="TRNovel 本地书库与分卷目录界面" loading="lazy" />
  </article>
  <article class="listening">
    <div class="feature-copy">
      <h3>读累了，听下一章。</h3>
      <p>开启 TTS 听书，让声音继续故事。当前源码支持独立听书程序与正文跟读高亮。</p>
      <a href="/TRNovel/guides/tts/">查看听书配置 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
    <Image src={listening} width={300} widths={[240,400]} sizes="(min-width:768px) 250px, 220px" alt="小卷戴着耳机听故事" loading="lazy" />
  </article>
  <article class="keyboard">
    <h3>让键盘顺着你的习惯。</h3>
    <div class="keys" aria-hidden="true"><kbd>↑</kbd><kbd>↓</kbd><kbd>Enter</kbd></div>
    <p>翻页、查目录、搜正文。主题和键位都能调整，Windows、macOS、Linux 均可使用。</p>
    <a href="/TRNovel/guides/keybindings/">自定义键位 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </article>
  <article class="sources">
    <h3>书源规则，自己掌握。</h3>
    <code class="rule">URL → 搜索 → 目录 → 正文</code>
    <p>结构化 JSON 描述取值与处理规则。支持浏览器辅助，遇到站点变化可以逐步校验。</p>
    <a href="/TRNovel/book-source/intro/">阅读书源参考 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </article>
</div>
<style>
  .tn-features {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 7fr 5fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  article {
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--tn-surface);
    min-width: 0;
  }
  h3 {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--tn-ink);
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2vw, 1.6rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  p {
    margin: 1rem 0;
    color: var(--tn-muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    max-width: 42em;
  }
  a {
    display: inline-flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    color: var(--tn-accent);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .library {
    padding-bottom: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .library img {
    display: block;
    width: calc(100% + 4rem);
    max-width: none;
    margin: 2rem -2rem 0;
    height: auto;
  }
  .listening {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    background: var(--tn-surface-2);
  }
  .listening img {
    display: block;
    width: 250px;
    max-width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    align-self: center;
    margin: auto auto 0;
  }
  .keyboard,
  .sources {
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid var(--tn-border);
  }
  .keys {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }
  kbd {
    padding: 0.7rem 0.9rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--tn-border);
    border-bottom: 3px solid var(--tn-border);
    border-radius: 5px;
    background: var(--tn-surface);
    font: 0.85rem var(--tn-mono);
    color: var(--tn-ink);
  }
  .rule {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    padding: 1rem 0;
    background: none;
    color: var(--tn-accent);
    font: 0.85rem var(--tn-mono);
  }
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .tn-features {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    article {
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }
    .library img {
      width: calc(100% + 3rem);
      margin-inline: -1.5rem;
    }
    .listening img {
      width: 220px;
    }
  }
</style>
